{"ID":"20240118151037-d2eyljt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151037-d2eyljt","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151037-d2eyljt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151037-ui58ipr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143337-0ugqdx9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122143337-0ugqdx9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"258粉锡","type":"doc","updated":"20240202110238"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151037-ui58ipr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151037-ui58ipr","updated":"20240122143312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本绖原文】味辛，寒，无毒。治伏尸，毒螫，杀三虫。锡镜鼻，平。治女子血闭，症瘕，伏肠，绝孕。生山谷。一名解锡。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143314-8r203mk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143314-8r203mk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】以醋蒸铅化合而成，日本产此甚多，我国亦有制出，色白，故亦曰白粉，以其为铅所化，故亦曰铅粉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143317-6jlrd3m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143317-6jlrd3m"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性寒，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143318-h1xts7o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143318-h1xts7o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】粉锡为外用要药，作膏药，治溃疡，制妆品，除皮病。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143320-8f5x6da","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143320-8f5x6da"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】去鳖瘕。疗恶疮，止小便利，堕胎。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143321-05y290o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143321-05y290o"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治积聚不消，炒焦止小儿疳痢。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143322-28eq8rk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143322-28eq8rk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治痈肿瘘烂，呕逆，疗症瘕，小儿疳气。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143324-52csf21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143324-52csf21"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通皆外用，内服甚少，即用，亦宜轻量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143325-jfiwe69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143325-jfiwe69"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】粉钖用以制妆品，久用蚀血，反使面色不华，故妇女常用粉者，去粉则面黄，且少血色。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122143312-501u300","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143312-501u300"}},{"ID":"20240122143326-87futyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143326-87futyy"}},{"ID":"20240122143326-aymnos2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143326-aymnos2","updated":"20240202105811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第258粉锡，是外用的药，不内服的。粉锡，锡类的，都是外用。一般来说，毒虫咬伤，虫蛇咬伤，解毒的都可以使用，那产地呢，这个是用醋来蒸铅得到的，我们也叫做铅粉，味辛性寒无毒，这个粉锡呢，是外用药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122143337-0ugqdx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122143337-0ugqdx9","updated":"20240202110238"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大家看[别录]，会用到粉锡的地方就是皮肤的硬块，这个病名叫鳖瘕，就是你皮肤生的硬块，硬的像鳖壳一样，硬壳很硬一块，这个硬疮生在皮肤表面上面，不痛又不痒，这个时候我们会使用到粉锡，这个是治疗皮肤病用的。这个里面的使用呢，诸位可以参考一下书上面写的。一般来说，过去的化妆品使用，使用太多反而不好，使用太多会伤到血，一般来说我们对皮肤上的硬疮，就直接撒一点在上面，涂在上面都没有关系，这个外用药。"}]}]}